WEBVTT

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.260
Ikegafuchi Hot Springs.
The inside story of resort development.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.790
That's the city we traveled
to a little while ago, isn't it?

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:23.980
Yeah, it is. Isn't it, Miyu?

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.170
Yes, it is.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.810
I wonder... what the boy's doing?

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:21.200
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:25.250
and lead them to ruin.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:31.200
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:38.980
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.860
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:49.550
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:54.890
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:59.540
No one knows her true face.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.030
Scenic spot: The Hot Spring of Hell

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:32.000
Welcome to Ikegafuchi

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.970
Miyu, aren't you glad you
decided to come with us?

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.170
Yes. It's nice doing
this once in a while.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.950
It'd be much better
if it weren't raining.

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.840
Don't complain.
We're almost there.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:56.720
How strange.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.660
This town seems to create
a nostalgic atmosphere.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:04.220
Why don't we go for a walk
before we soak in the hot spring.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:05.560
That's a good idea.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.200
Shinma?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.540
If you're going to the town,
be careful not to get abducted.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.470
Abducted?

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:24.010
Oh, it's just a rumor though.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.810
Only because many people
have gone missing recently.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.250
The silly rumor is a problem...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.620
since this town is about to start
the development of a new resort.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.520
Well then, enjoy your stay.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.030
Getting abducted?
She can't be serious.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.770
Well, the story could be made-up
just to make the town famous.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:45.500
Jeez, Yukari.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.550
Abducted?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.980
No doubt this time.
A Shinma's shadow.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.070
Miyu, what do you think?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.480
Huh?

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:08.350
Still though,
I wonder where Miyu went.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.590
Restaurant: Fukujuya

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.330
Somehow, the atmosphere
of this town reminds me of Miyu.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:16.170
Don't you agree, Chisato?

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:27.510
It's like we've stepped
into a different world.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.280
Isn't it, Yukari?

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.210
Hisae?

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:42.120
Now Chisato's lost, too.
What a trip we're having.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:44.130
She's such a slowpoke.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.560
Maybe, she's heading
back to the hotel.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.900
Y... Yukari!!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.570
Ewww! So gross!

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.080
Man, that's why I hate
the countryside!

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.580
Wait, Yukari!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.750
Oh no, now I'm lost too.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.250
The other girls must
be worried about me.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:21.090
It's like a maze.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:31.010
I don't care where
just get me outta here!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.880
Why is there a rock
in the middle of?

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.890
W... where... is this?

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:55.230
Now... it looks like I'm really lost.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:08.670
I've got no choice.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.650
I might as well
take shelter from rain.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.750
Excuse me.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.380
A mirror?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.670
Hey, you shouldn't scare people.

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:37.340
Go home now, okay?

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.620
Welcome back!
You're finally back.

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:46.510
You're not her...

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.520
S... Snake!!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:54.230
No!!! No!! No!!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.460
Is it gone?!
Is the snake gone?!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.830
It's alright now?

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:04.200
Right? Right?!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:07.340
What a wimpy girl you are.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.210
What do you mean wimpy?!
You're a little cheeky boy!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.380
No!

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.020
You're definitely not her.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:20.230
I thought you were,
but she isn't a wimp.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:23.720
Well, I'm sorry I wasn't
the girl you were expecting.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.520
What's the matter?

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.730
It got my hopes up.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.290
I thought she'd really come back.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:35.730
Who is she?
Are you waiting for someone?

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:40.310
I've been waiting a while...
'cause I promised.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:48.740
Thanks for saving me
from that snake earlier.

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:54.080
Hey, you wanna play with me?
I've been bored here all by myself.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:55.850
But what do you wanna do?

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.690
So you will, won't you?

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.990
Yeah, when it stops raining.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:00.920
Okay.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.500
Now, what shall we play?

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:16.600
Shinma!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.910
It's faint but I feel it.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.310
Why don't you stop
hiding and come out.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.020
No!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.300
A Shinma.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.470
No, it's not.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.210
Flame!!

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.920
Something's definitely there.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.130
Something that
controlled those snakes.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:35.360
Big sister, I got you!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:36.750
No, you haven't got me yet.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.370
That's not fair! Big sister!

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:42.450
Hey, Demon, over here,
I wait clapping.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:43.890
Hey, Demon, over here.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.430
Wait up, big sister!

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.700
Hey, wait up!

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:52.530
Over here!

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.700
Come on, big sister!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:01.140
Are you all right?

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.920
You gotta be careful, okay?

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.120
Okay. Thanks.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.030
I got you!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.070
Ah, you got me!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.250
When did it get so late.
I should get going.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.580
No. Let's play little longer.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.950
Besides, it's your turn
to be the Demon.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.350
But my friends must be worried.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.960
Your family is probably
worried about you, too.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.530
You should hurry home.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:55.730
Go home? I can't.
I can't leave this swamp.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:01.270
Because... I promised her.

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:02.640
Promised?

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:03.470
Yeah.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.810
I promised her I would protect this
swamp until she comes back.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.520
I promised her a long time ago.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:09.810
Protect the swamp?

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:13.520
So play with me a little
longer, big sister.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.280
Protect the swamp?

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:17.350
You can't? You can't play?

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:19.730
I know.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:21.630
How about I come back tomorrow?

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:22.920
Tomorrow?

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:23.620
I know.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:27.030
We're leaving for
Tokyo by train tomorrow.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.830
So, I'll come
see you before I leave.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:31.460
How does that sound?

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:32.370
Really?

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.970
Really. I promise.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.270
Okay, you promise.

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.240
Yeah.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.080
Or I'll swallow a thousand needles.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.180
See you tomorrow.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.810
Okay, I'll be waiting.

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:52.020
Bye-bye, big sister.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.370
Strange kid.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:02.930
A promise, eh?

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:04.340
Chisato!

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.270
Yukari... Hisae?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.950
What do you mean "Yukari"?
You really made us worry.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:21.950
Where in the world have you been?
We looked everywhere for you.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.490
I made a friend with a local kid.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.060
I feel like a young kid again.

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:30.420
I was just playing with him
in the forest earlier.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:31.690
Forest?

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.160
Earlier? When was that?

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:36.060
In the forest near the swamp.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:44.410
No way.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.610
Why did you let her go?

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:02.180
I thought you were abducting
humans in the town.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.060
Seems I was wrong.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.630
What are you talking about?
Who are you?

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.970
What are you doing here?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:14.370
I'm just keeping my promise.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.070
I was asked to protect this swamp.
By the girl...

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.440
This swamp?

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.080
I see.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.140
So that's it.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.600
You... you wouldn't be?

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:37.720
Reiha, this boy is different!

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:41.460
Oh, how is he different?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.780
I must say this place is really nice.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.940
It has something
that makes me nostalgic.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.480
What a perfect place
for a Shinma to hide.

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:55.880
Don't you lay a finger on him... Reiha.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.080
You just seemed to have
been off your guard.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:01.420
What kind of thanks is that?

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:04.690
When we are kindly helping
out the Guardian.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:09.020
I don't need any help from you.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:12.730
Then we shall have to decide
who will finish him.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:18.530
Stop this!

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:22.040
What you just said
sounds odd to me.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.280
You don't mean
to let him go, do you?

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.580
After all he's a stray Shinma.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:28.310
You're wrong!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:29.610
We are not wrong!

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:32.380
D... Don't!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.200
The mirror!

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.020
Mirror?

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:09.720
I'm sorry.
I broke my promise.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.300
What the heck is going on here?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.760
This boy was the
guardian for the seal.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:19.660
And that...

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:22.930
is the true Shinma.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:38.180
JYA-KA

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.320
Finally the seal is broken.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:02.500
Oh, it's like absorbing the great
energy in a human's blood.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.950
This is what it means
to reawaken, indeed.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:10.580
What a disgusting kid you are!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:14.380
You were keeping the seal on me
this whole time!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:19.320
You vexed me enough that
I'll wipe you out of existence!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:40.440
I'm sorry to have waken you,
stray Shinma.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:44.750
But this time I'll put
the seal on so well...

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.140
you'll be sleeping
for a long time to come.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.290
Another guardian?!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.390
Well, I won't be beaten
so easily this time!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.100
How foolish.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:04.840
As you are originally an aristocrat,
you are supposed to be on our side.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.030
Why do you stand against us now?

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:08.760
Because...

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:12.280
I promised to protect this swamp.

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:13.340
Promised the girl.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.250
The girl?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.280
Nonsense!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:19.040
That promise is about to be broken!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.320
What?!

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.790
Damn you!!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.160
Larva!

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:41.570
Stray Shinma, to the Dark!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:17:59.380
Isn't that?

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:28.790
Now you've been
freed from this swamp.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.980
Just like that Shinma has.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:35.890
You have the freedom to go
anywhere you like now.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.130
No.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:38.990
I'm not going anywhere.

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.970
I'm still waiting here.
'Cause I promised her.

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:47.700
Promise?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:48.270
Yeah.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:58.380
It seems that Miyu has
no intention of finishing him.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.040
That little punk
is still a stray Shinma.

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:02.480
Are we just gonna let him go?

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.870
Of course, we shouldn't.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:11.060
But I must say he is
too easy for us to fight.

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:13.500
In other words...

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:16.800
taking out that punk isn't worth
provoking Miyu, right?

00:19:18.310 --> 00:19:22.830
It would seem so.
Let us retire for now.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:28.910
Thank you, big sister.

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:40.090
Promise, eh?

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:05.290
Look, Chisato.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:05.750
What?

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:07.750
No Trespassing

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.430
No Trespassing
No trespassing?

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:09.820
No Trespassing

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:12.050
Why?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.690
Can't we go any further?

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:16.730
Excuse me! Can't we go inside?

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.800
No, this land is
under construction now.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:23.700
They've finally decided
to develop a resort.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.180
Develop a resort?

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:30.210
First, they'll chop down the forest,
then build the resort area.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:31.880
That forest?

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.340
So, hurry on back.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.610
But I promised him.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.250
There's nothing we can do, Chisato.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.690
That boy won't be able
to get in, either.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.110
The train's gonna leave
if we waste any more time.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.510
Yeah... you're right.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:48.690
Come to think of it...

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:51.420
I forgot to ask him his name.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.750
Miyu! Hey, Miyu!

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:29.230
Come on, we're gonna be late, Miyu.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.000
Okay, I'm coming.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.840
Such accidents have continued...

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:38.570
and it's rumored as "a cursed resort"
among the local people.

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:40.740
That boy...

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:43.110
is still waiting there.

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:46.420
Keeping his promise.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:50.750
Hurry up, Miyu!

00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:53.590
I know, Chisato.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:17.610
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:24.150
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:30.730
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:38.360
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:43.070
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:46.770
I don't need friends.

00:22:46.810 --> 00:22:47.840
That's a lie.

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:51.020
I don't even need myself.

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:52.040
It's the truth.

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:59.980
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:07.930
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:15.230
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:24.820
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:31.580
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:06.390 --> 00:25:08.980
Yesterday, a youth died in this town.

00:25:09.790 --> 00:25:12.190
Today, the youth obtained a new face.

00:25:12.960 --> 00:25:15.150
A new self and a new life.

00:25:15.930 --> 00:25:18.800
Or rather the illusion
of life given by a Shinma.

00:25:19.370 --> 00:25:21.730
But there's nothing I can do for him.

00:25:22.140 --> 00:25:24.470
I can only dispose of the Shinma.

00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:28.770
Next time Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Supple Face".

00:25:29.540 --> 00:25:31.810
The past is what the heart
cannot let go of.
